    "url": "https://awiloqmh.github.io/CancerReportingTemplate/GI-Gallbladder.html",
    "staging": "AJCC 8th edition pTNM derived from the tumour-extension ticks (hepatic-side pT2b versus peritoneal-side pT2a preserved, and the T3 organ rule — liver plus at most one extrahepatic organ — checked against the T4 threshold of two or more extrahepatic organs or the portal vein / hepatic artery), the nodal counts and the distant-metastasis options. Cycling the extension options wipes the override. pTNM prints only with the printPTNM option, stamped (AJCC 8th edition); the stage-group line also prints there. Treatment effect maps to the y descriptor automatically.",
    "stagingProtocol": "gallbladder",
    "grading": "WHO 2019 digestive tumours histologic type and grade; tumour size is in cm as on the QMH page (aggregate size of all invasive foci)."
  },
